// BaselScript structural block definitions
//
// Format:
// type;start_token;start_match;end_token;end_match
//
// match:
//   Exact  = token must match completely
//   Prefix = legacy StartsWith(...) behavior
//
// Order is significant and preserves StructureValidator legacy behavior.
//
// SCENE is intentionally not in this file yet.
// It has special grammar: SCENE=<name> and END SCENE [name].

SECTION;sec;Prefix;sec;Prefix
ACTION;act;Prefix;act;Prefix
MENU;menu;Prefix;menu;Exact
LIST;list;Prefix;list;Exact
DIALOG;dia;Prefix;dia;Prefix
FORM;form;Prefix;form;Exact
POPUPMENU;popupmenu;Prefix;popupmenu;Exact
